{"products":[{"id":9846041870638,"title":"SpeediLight Sticks Charcoal Starters","handle":"speedilight-sticks","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eLight your Egg quickly and easily with Big Green Egg SpeediLight Sticks Charcoal Starters. Each 5-inch stick ignites faster and covers more charcoal surface than traditional fire starter cubes - so you only need one to get cooking. Whether you're firing up for a low-and-slow cook or a high-heat sear, these starters deliver dependable results for your every day cook. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick, Even Start:\u003c\/strong\u003e The 5-inch stick design touches more charcoal at once, delivering a fast, even light to get your Egg up to temperature with minimal effort. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClean Burn Confidence:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from certified non-toxic materials with no harsh chemicals, SpeediLight Sticks offer a safe, odor-free ignition you can trust every time you fire up your Egg. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to Break Off:\u003c\/strong\u003e Just break off a stick \u0026amp; get fired up — no tearing, no mess. It’s as simple as breaking a candy bar. \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-07-18T11:07:58-04:00","created_at":"2025-06-19T21:40:10-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Fire Starters","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":50571250041134,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"136473","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"10.99","grams":454,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9846041870638,"created_at":"2025-06-19T21:40:11-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":50352727490862,"created_at":"2025-06-19T22:01:40-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-22T12:21:45-04:00","product_id":9846041870638,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/