03e\u003cspan\u003eAll you need is one, Twisters pack twice the fuel mass of a standard tumbleweed firestarter for faster, hotter, more reliable starts. \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-11-11T09:29:37-05:00","created_at":"2025-07-28T23:17:20-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Fire Starters","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":50813602758958,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"136909","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"12.99","grams":227,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9877865955630,"created_at":"2025-07-28T23:17:20-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":51093661253934,"created_at":"2025-08-27T15:24:47-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-27T15:26:11-04:00","product_id":9877865955630,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC06553copy.jpg?v=1756322771","width":1024,"height":683}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9654623109422,"title":"SpeediLight® Natural Charcoal Starters","handle":"speedilight-natural-charcoal-starters","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eSpeediLight All Natural Charcoal Starters are compact squares designed for effortless lighting and clean burning. These 24 compact squares light effortlessly, delivering a pure, clean burn without chemical odors or residues. Enhancing your egg cooking system, they eliminate the need for lighter fluid, ensuring your dishes retain their authentic flavors. SpeediLight starters seamlessly integrate into your outdoor cooking ritual, providing a consistent, reliable ignition every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e24 squares per box\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll-natural composition\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOdorless and tasteless\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo chemical additives\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:18-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Fire Starters","tags":["BS","GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590059860270,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"120922","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"9.99","grams":227,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654623109422,"created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48325955420462,"created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:20-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-01-14T15:45:00-05:00","product_id":9654623109422,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/charcoal-starters-800x500-1.png?v=1736887500","width":800,"height":500}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10601095528750,"title":"Quick Light™ Kit","handle":"quick-light-kit","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur Quick Light™ charcoal grate and starter tool give you a better way to start the fire. Whether you're a seasoned grill master or new to cooking on the Egg, the Quick Light™ Kit gives you faster, more reliable ignition, less ash buildup, cleaner hands, and more even-burning coals. Light your charcoal from below, every time you start your Egg.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eReady to Cook Sooner:\u003c\/strong\u003e Efficient ignition from the bottom of the Egg helps you reach cooking temperature more quickly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCleaner hands: \u003c\/strong\u003eNo need to bury a fire starter or rearrange charcoal by hand. Simply dump charcoal into your Egg’s firebox and light it from below.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Even Heat: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe honeycomb grate improves airflow to help minimize hot spots and maintain consistent cooking temperatures. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReduces Ash Buildup: \u003c\/strong\u003eLarger grate openings allow ash to fall through for easier cleanup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt to Last: \u003c\/strong\u003eHeavy-duty 430 stainless steel can stand up to decades of high-heat cooking.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with M, L, XL and 2XL Eggs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ci\u003e(Quick Light Tool does not work with cast iron charcoal grate.)\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-15T14:38:05-04:00","created_at":"2026-07-13T16:29:30-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Fire Starters","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":52306569953582,"title":"M","option1":"M","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"138439","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"149.99","grams":1361,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":10601095528750,"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:13:32-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"},{"id":52307767492910,"title":"L","option1":"L","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"138446","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"149.99","grams":2041,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":10601095528750,"created_at":"2026-07-13T16:19:26-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"},{"id":52307795935534,"title":"XL, 2XL","option1":"XL, 2XL","option2":"Default Title","optio