e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCleaner hands: \u003c\/strong\u003eNo need to bury a fire starter or rearrange charcoal by hand. Simply dump charcoal into your Egg’s firebox and light it from below.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Even Heat: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe honeycomb grate improves airflow to help minimize hot spots and maintain consistent cooking temperatures. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReduces Ash Buildup: \u003c\/strong\u003eLarger grate openings allow ash to fall through for easier cleanup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt to Last: \u003c\/strong\u003eHeavy-duty 430 stainless steel can stand up to decades of high-heat cooking.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with L Eggs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ci\u003e(Quick Light Tool does not work with cast iron charcoal grate.)\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-23T17:02:11-04:00","created_at":"2026-07-13T16:19:26-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Fire Starters","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":52307767492910,"title":"L","option1":"L","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"138446","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"149.99","grams":2041,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":10601085010222,"created_at":"2026-07-13T16:19:26-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:43-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":54317734428974,"created_at":"2026-07-15T16:58:00-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:58:02-04:00","product_id":10601085010222,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/QuickStart011_bc5593bc